; What happens when the player goes to the endless fun webpage

; set variables
@set playerInteractedWithEndlessFun=false

; show dialogue
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Noa: ...
Noa: ...
Noa: By Beata, my favorite creeps-giver.
Noa: I wonder what the guy who came up with its design was thinking.
Noa: Probably something along the lines of, “When will my automatic feeder dispense more of these rainbow blotters?”
Noa: ...
Noa: ...
Noa: Subscribe? Since when? Open-access journalism my ass.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@set playerInteractedWithEndlessFun=true


@stop